					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Formam pacis ultimo submissam accepimus, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>ut ante monui, <placeName ref="l41">Berna</placeName>; sed dubiam et supposititiam <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>omnino esse arbitror; nam praeteritis diebus singularis <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>meus amicus rediit in <placeName ref="l822">Germaniam</placeName>, qui toto belli <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>tempore cum principe fuit et <placeName ref="l367">Aurelia</placeName> digressus <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>est mense aprilis.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Is ad me literas dedit, cuius exem<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>plum hic ad te mitto Germanicum; plus huic tribuo <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>fidei quam ullis aliis.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Est praeterea satelles quidam <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>regis, qui consuli nostro amplissimo d. <persName ref="p3493">a Chaam</persName> ex <placeName ref="l378">Lutetia</placeName> mense <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>aprilis paria prope scripsit, nisi quod in suis <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>addit <persName>regem Germano</persName> equitatui persoluturum stipendia <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>et pacem coiisse bonam, solos Guisianos subinde <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>moliri nova.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Dominus coherceat eos!</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Festinanter <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>haec scripsi; tu haec boni consulas, oro.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Tuas literas accepi per amplissimum hunc doctorem, virum optimum.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Utinam ignis verbi dei in regno papae ardeat et <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>antichristum consumat!</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Si quid aliud et amplius accepero, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>mature significabo.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Quid, oro, fit cum <persName ref="p8441">Schvenck<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>feldianis</persName> etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Optime vale cum uxore et liberis <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>et amicis omnibus, d. d.d consulibus, <persName ref="p20473">Ganthnero</persName>, <persName ref="p6130">Pontisella</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>et reliquis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>, 10. maii 1568.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName> tuissimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Der gwardiknächt schript ouch minem herren <persName>von <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Chaam</persName>, daß der könig yngesetz habe <placeName ref="l322">Metz</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/><placeName ref="l503">Thun</placeName>, <placeName ref="l1920">Verdun</placeName> etc. und das ein sorg syge, groß <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>krieg werde sich erheben imm <placeName ref="l20">Niderland</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>wi<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>der duca <persName>de Alba</persName>, den die <placeName ref="l20">Niderländer</placeName> nemmend duck dich <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>an galgen.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Hoc non satelles addit, sed ego <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>ex literis ex <placeName ref="l808">Belgio</placeName> allati<note type="margin">dazu a.R.: Hoc - allatis Zus. a.R. auf d. Zus v. "wider" an bezügl., urspr. hinter "Niderland" ein Punkt.</note>.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Ornatissimo viro d. <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p8016">Thobiae Eglio</persName>, <placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesiae fideli <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ministro, domino colendo et <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>fratri charissimo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Chur.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>